dna-vault-count-animal = Distinct animals: { $count } / { $goal }
dna-vault-probe-count = Stored records: { $count } / { $capacity }.
dna-vault-scanned = Sample recorded.
dna-vault-duplicate = Duplicate record or probe memory full.
dna-vault-loaded = Records or cartridge accepted.
dna-vault-insert-help = Requires new probe records, or a free slot and an analyzed compatible patient cartridge.
dna-vault-patient-help = Insert an analyzed patient cartridge. Probe records do not replace personal analysis.
dna-vault-prepare = Prepare activator and suppressor
dna-vault-preparing = Preparing a personal kit. Power loss pauses the cycle.
dna-vault-ready = Collection complete. Personal preparation available.
dna-vault-collecting = Waiting for distinct samples.
dna-vault-claimed = This DNA has already claimed a kit or has a pending order elsewhere. A new issue needs another patient's cartridge and a newly completed collection.
dna-vault-unavailable = Preparation unavailable. Check samples, power, biomass and patient entitlement.
dna-vault-reward-load = Load: { $load } / 100. Does not increase the load limit or stack with the same gene.
